{"resourceIdentifier":"3830","resourceName":"Jiyuan Weiheng Cow Breeding Farm Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project","description":"The project is located at west of Huaiyin Village, Dayu Town, Jiyuan City, Henan Province, P.R. China. The project is owned and implemented by Jiyuan Weiheng Cow Breeding Co., Ltd.. The project will introduce new anaerobic animal manure management system to treat manure of daily cow from Jiyuan Weiheng Cow Breeding Farm, which has 10,000 daily cows. The project uses digester to treat animal manure, collect and destroy the generated biogas to avoid methane emissions. The generated biogas will be captured and used for kitchen and the rest will be flared within the project site. The residual waste from the digester will be used for organic fertilizer production with aerobic composting.","location":{"latitude":35.040010,"longitude":112.334880},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-29","endExclusive":"2022-12-30","endInclusive":"2022-12-29"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3830"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiyuan Weiheng Cow Breeding Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"37493"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"30/10/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 15/06/